  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Greening Private Enterprises in Kosovo (GPEK) SDC</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Gr&#xf6;n omst&#xe4;llning av privata f&#xf6;retag i Kosovo (GPEK) SDC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Greening Private Enterprises in Kosovo (GPEK), SDC, aims to raise awareness among private companies about sustainability, support them in adopting greener technologies, and facilitate their transition through a Challenge Fund that encourages investment in and application of these technologies.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Greening Private Enterprises in Kosovo (GPEK), SDC, syftar till att &#xf6;ka medvetenheten bland privata f&#xf6;retag om h&#xe5;llbarhet, st&#xf6;dja dem i att anta gr&#xf6;nare teknologier och underl&#xe4;tta deras omst&#xe4;llning genom en utlysningsfond som &#xe4;r designad f&#xf6;r investeringar i och till&#xe4;mpning av dessa teknologier.</narrative>
  </description>
